Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:46.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你帮我找来这套衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:47.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did this to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:47.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你帮他找的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? I thought he'd love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  我觉得他一定会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:53.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His favorite kid's book was the Velveteen Rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:53.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他最喜欢的儿童读物是《绒毛兔》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Velveteen Rabbit was brown and white!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绒毛兔是棕白相间的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:59.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it was either a pink bunny or no bunny at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:59.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有粉红色的兔子装  不然就没得穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:02.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No bunny at all. Always no bunny at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:02.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来就不想穿兔子装  没有正好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't dress up either?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也没有变装
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:09.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I did. I'm Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:09.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我有  我扮成了钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:16.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dude, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.16,0:05:16.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}兄弟  你这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:20.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} How is that me?  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:20.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么会是那个样子  看着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:22.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:22.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的很像你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When have I ever done that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我什么时候是那副德行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:30.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When have I ever done that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:30.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我什么时候是那副德行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:36.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Trick or treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.15,0:05:36.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不给糖就捣蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:45.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You're the prettiest ballerina I've ever seen.  Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:45.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我见过最漂亮的芭蕾舞娘  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That deserves another piece of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该再给你一颗糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:50.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:50.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:56.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to say, that earns "twotwo" pieces of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:56.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就冲这个我也该再给你一些糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:05:59.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:05:59.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:03.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, here, take it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:03.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜心  统统拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica? We need more candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  糖果没了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:14.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What? There's only been four kids.  I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.14,0:06:14.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚刚只来了四个孩子  我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:18.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But one said she loved me, so I gave her everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:18.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有个孩子说她爱我  于是我全部都给她了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No wonder you're pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.42,0:06:20.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难怪你会怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这次扮成什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember the Russian satellite, Sputnik?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得俄罗斯卫星史波尼克号吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm a potato. Or a "spud"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我扮成了马铃薯  或是"史波多"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and these are my antenna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的天线
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.23,0:06:44.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So Sputnik becomes...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.23,0:06:44.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以史波尼克变成了...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.27,0:06:51.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Spudnik! Spudnik!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.27,0:06:51.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史波多尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow! I don't have the worst costume anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:56.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原来我不是变装最失败的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:01.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right! Ross came as doodie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:01.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  罗斯扮成了一坨屎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:05.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm not doodie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.81,0:07:05.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我不是屎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, spacedoodie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  你是"屎"波尼克
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Aren't you gonna give me a kiss?  Okay, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不打算吻我吗  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But right after, you have to tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.24,0:07:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我吻了你之后  你得告诉我你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Ursula?  Ursula's fiance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}厄休拉  厄休拉的未婚夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:31.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Oh, my god. You're the sister.  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:31.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是她的妹妹  对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I just slapped my future sisterinlaw's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚打了我未来小姨子的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Yeah.  I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  我真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, is your mother here? Maybe I can give her a little slap on the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你妈妈在这里吗  我可以打她的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:41.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} My mother killed herself.  See, and I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:41.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈自杀死掉了  看吧  我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:46.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now I'm sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:46.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我满身大汗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at me, I'm really sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧啊  我在流汗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:50.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now I'm saying, "Look at me," I'm getting even sweatier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:50.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你说话的功夫  汗还在不断往外冒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:52.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I probably should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:52.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. That's okay. We'll start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事  我们从头来过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hi, I'm Phoebe.  Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  我是菲比  我是艾力克
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:07:58.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:07:58.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么要那样子看我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}'Cause the sweat's getting in my eyes and its burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:00.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为汗滴到我眼睛里了  疼得慌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:03.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Thank you.  There.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:03.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} So, what are you?  I don't think they have a name for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:06.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这是什么  应该还没有正规的命名
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:08.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I get nervous, and I sweat like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:08.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一紧张就会满身大汗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:15.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} No, I meant your costume.  I'm a solar system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:15.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我是指你的服装  我扮成了太阳系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, my students helped me make it. I teach the second grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我的学生们帮我做的  我教二年级
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:21.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I love the second grade.  Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:21.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可喜欢二年级了  真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:22.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah! It's so much better than first grade
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:22.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比一年级好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:24.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when you don't know what's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:24.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一年级什么也不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:27.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and definitely better than third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:27.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也比三年级好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.07,0:08:29.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With all the politics and the mind games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.07,0:08:29.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三年级的尔虞我诈  勾心斗角
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.64,0:08:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} So, what do you do?  I'm a masseuse, by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.64,0:08:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是做哪一行的  我白天做按摩师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:40.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You don't have to stand here with me.  I'm having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:40.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不必陪我  我觉得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:43.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm excited for you and Ursula.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:43.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为你跟厄休拉感到高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel very lucky. She's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:45.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得自己很幸运  她太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:49.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think she's the most beautiful woman I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:49.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是我见过最漂亮的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hey, Joey?  Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.98,0:08:58.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:02.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You read comic books, right?  Exclusively.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:02.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看漫画书吧  我是专家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:07.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who do you think would win in a fight, Catwoman or Supergirl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:07.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果猫女跟女超人打架  谁会赢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Catwoman, hands down.  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然是猫女  是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:12.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Between you and Phoebe ? I'd give the edge to Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.08,0:09:12.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你跟菲比  我赌菲比会赢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:15.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What? Really?  You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:15.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  真的吗  你开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:17.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe lived on the street, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:17.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比在街上混过  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:19.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Plus, she's got a crazy temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.17,0:09:19.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且她生起气来跟疯婆子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's not right behind me, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没有站在我后面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:25.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:25.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  你很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:28.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Could I take Rachel?  I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:28.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能打倒瑞秋吗  我不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:30.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Come on, I am tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:30.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  少来了  我很强悍的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Punch me right here, as hard as you can!
