Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:36.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you relax?! What are you taking this so seriously for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:36.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别激动  你为什么这么当真呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:39.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} It doesn't matter.  Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:39.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不重要  真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:43.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if I told you Ross or Chandler could beat you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:43.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我说罗斯或钱德勒能打倒你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would say, "Woman, please."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:45.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会说"姑娘  别闹了"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:50.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ursula's fiance is really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:50.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}厄休拉的未婚夫人真的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:53.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a teacher, he does all this volunteer work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:53.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是老师  他会做义工
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Normally, I don't like sweaty guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}通常我不喜欢爱流汗的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I could just mop him up.
