Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're getting a crush on your sister's fiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在暗恋你姐姐的未婚夫
