Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what, honey? We're actually out of candy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:18.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道吗  亲爱的  我们没有糖果了
