Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:27.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以开张支票给你吗  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  你叫什么名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:32.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lelani Mayolanofavich.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:32.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}李兰妮·马尤拉诺法维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:37.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm just gonna write this out to "cash."
