Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey's gonna be thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.17,0:10:45.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊一定会很兴奋
