Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:54.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以为我听了这话会觉得丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.79,0:10:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but you see, I'm maxed out.
