Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.33,0:11:21.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没办法回答  钱德勒是我老公
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} So Ross?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯会赢  对
