Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:52.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In fact, when we were building in Uruguay,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在乌拉圭做义工时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:12:01.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}we were two towns apart and we never met.
